---
description: Thin-slice agentic development — brief, review gate, reflect
alwaysApply: true
---

This project may use Slice Engineering. If `.slice-engineering/config.yaml`
exists, follow it.

- Prefer one thin vertical slice: one behavior, explicit exclusions, independently testable.
- Durable work belongs in a ledger brief with a named frontier. Plans are temporary.
- Treat review as a ship gate. Fresh context. Do not loop on style preferences.
- Tests specify behavior. Do not ship a behavior change with no executable spec unless the host bindings say the change is docs-only or mechanical.
- Promote durable knowledge to the homes in the bindings file. Do not keep team facts only in chat memory.
- Read `skills/_shared/bindings.md` before assuming how this repo tests or ships.
